    "chunk_text": "(3) The Order published in the Gazette under subsection(1) shall be placed before the Parliament for its approval.\n\n(4) A Notification specifying of the date on whichParliament has approved the Order shall be published in theGazette.\n\n9. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nValidation.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nCode of Criminal Procedure (Special Provisions) Act, No. 42 of 20079\n\nSection 102 - Penal Code\n\nSection 113B - Penal Code\n\nSection 296 - Penal Code\n\nSection 297 - Penal Code\n\nSection 300 - Penal Code\n\nSection 355 - Penal Code\n\nSection 356 - Penal Code\n\nSection 358 - Penal Code\n\nSection 359 - Penal Code\n\nSection 364 - Penal Code\n\nSection 371 - Penal Code\n\nSection 383 - Penal Code\n\nSection 384 - Penal Code\n\nSection 490 - Penal Code\n\nExplosive as defined in theexplosives Act (Chapter183); offensive weapon asdefined in the OffensiveWeapons Act, No 18 of1966 and a Gun as definedin the Firearms Ordinance(Chapter 182).\n\nSCHEDULE(Section 2)\n\nColumn IColumn II\n\n1. Abetment of an offence set out in theSchedule, if the act abetted iscommitted\n\n2. Conspiracy for the abetment orcommission of any offence set out inthe Schedule\n\n3. Murder\n\n4. Culpable Homicide not amounting tomurder\n\n5. Attempt to commit murder\n\n6. Kidnapping or abduction to commitmurder\n\n7. Kidnapping or abduction with intentto wrongfully confine a person\n\n8. Kidnapping or abduction with intentto wrongfully subject person togrievous hurt\n\n9. Concealing or keeping in confinementa kidnapped person\n\n10. Rape\n\n11. Theft, preparation having being madeto cause death &c,.\n\n12. Robbery with attempt to cause deathor grievous hurt\n\n13. Attempt to commit robbery whenarmed with deadly weapons\n\n14. Attempt to commit any of the aboveoffences\n\n15. An offence committed with the useof explosives, an offensive weaponor a gun\n\nCode