    "chunk_text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n4.In this Act \u2014\n\n\u201cUniversity of Kelaniya\u201d means the University ofKelaniya established by an Order made undersection 25B of the Universities Act, No. 16 of1978.\n\nSCHEDULE(Section 2)\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nInterpretation.\n\n4Gampaha Wickramarachchi Ayurveda TeachingHospital (Transfer) Act, No. 51 of 2007\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 befor 15th December each year in respect of the year following."
