    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of April 08, 2009\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 08th April, 2009]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nJAGADDALA SOCIAL WELFAREINSTITUTE (INCORPORATION)ACT, NO. 21 OF 2009\n\nJagaddala Social Welfare Institute(Incorporation) Act, No. 21 of 20091\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theJagaddalaSocialwelfareInstitute.\n\n[Certified on 08th April, 2009]\n\nL. D. \u2014 O. (Inc.) 18/2005\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JAGADDALA SOCIAL WELFARE INSTITUTE\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the\u201cJagaddalaSocial Welfare Institute\u201d has heretofore been formed at SriPunyawardanaramaya, Kindelpitiya, Bandaragama for thepurpose of effectually carrying out and transacting all objectsand matters connected with the said Institute according tothe rules agreed by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Institute has heretofor successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Jagaddala Social WelfareInstitute (Incorporation) Act, No. 21 of 2009."
