    "chunk_text": "4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall subject to therules of the Corporation be administered by a Committee ofManagement of not less than seven members including thePresident, Honorary Secretary, two Vice-Presidents andTreasurer to be elected in accordance with the rules in forcefor the time being of the Corporation.\n\n5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such Acts, matters and thingswhatsoever, as are necessary or desirable for the promotion orfurtherance of the objects of the Corporation or any of them,including the power to open, operate or close bank accounts,to borrow or raise moneys, with or without security, to receive\n\nManagement ofthe affairs of theCorporation.\n\nPowers of theCorporation.\n\nGamage Arthur Perera Foundation (Incorporation)Act, No. 26 of 20093\n\nor collect grants and donations to invest its funds and toengage, employ and dismiss officers and servants requiredfor the carrying out of the objects of the Corporation.\n\n6. (1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from time totime, at any general meeting and by a majority of not lessthan two-thirds of the members present and voting, to makerules, not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act or otherwritten law, for all or any of the following matters :\u2014\n\n(a)the classification of membership and the admission,withdrawal or expulsion of members ;\n\n(b)the election of the office-bearers, the resignationfrom or vacation of or removal from, office of officebearers and their power, conduct and duties ;\n\n(c)the election of the members of the Committee ofManagement and its powers, conduct and dutiesand the terms of office of members of the Committeeof Management ;\n\n(d)the powers, conduct, duties and functions of thevarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation ;"
