    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 7.00 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of May 22, 2009\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 18th May, 2009]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nWIDOWERS\u2019 AND ORPHANS\u2019 PENSIONSCHEME (ARMED FORCES) (AMENDMENT)ACT, NO. 28 OF 2009\n\n1Widowers\u2019 and Orphans\u2019 Pension Scheme(Armed Forces) (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 2009\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 18th May, 2009]\n\nL. D. \u2014 O. 56/2007\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE WIDOWERS\u2019 AND ORPHANS\u2019 PENSION SCHEME(ARMED FORCES) ACT, NO. 60 OF 1998\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Widowers\u2019 and Orphans\u2019Pension Scheme (Armed Forces) (Amendment) Act, No. 28of 2009.\n\n2.The Widowers\u2019 and Orphans\u2019 Pension Scheme (ArmedForces) Act, No. 60 of 1998 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d is hereby amended by the insertionimmediately after section 4 thereof, of the following newsection:\u2014\n\n4A. For the purposes of sections 3 and 4 ofthis Act, \u201ca member of the Armed Forces\u201d meansany person\u2014\n\n(a)who, being a female, is an officer orsoldier of the Regular Force of the SriLanka Army; or\n\n(b)who, being a female, is an officer orseaman of the Regular Naval Force ofthe Royal Ceylon Navy or the Sri LankaNavy, as the case may be; or\n\n(c)who being a female, is an officer orairman of the Regular Air Force of theRoyal Ceylon Air Force or the Sri LankaAir Force, as the case may be.\u201d.\n\nInsertion of newsection 4A inAct, No. 60 of1998.\n\n\u201cMeaning ofa \u201cmemberof the ArmedForces\u201d forthe purposeof sections 3and 4.\n\nWidowers\u2019 and Orphans\u2019 Pension Scheme(Armed Forces) (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 20092"
