    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nMAHINDANANDA ALUTHGAMAGE\n\nFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nACT, No. 75 OF 2009\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 23rd December, 2009]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of December 24, 2009\n\n1Mahindananda Aluthgamage Foundation\n\n(Incorporation) Act, No. 75 of 2009\n\n2\u2014PL 004442\u2014 3,150 (10/2009)\n\nShort title.\n\n[Certified on 23rd December 2009]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. INC 3/2009.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MAHINDANANDA ALUTHGAMAGE\n\nFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cMahindananda Aluthgamage Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen created for the purpose of effectually carrying outand transacting all objects and matters connected with thesaid Foundation according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which the said Foundation was established,and has applied to be incorporated, and it will be for thepublic advantage to grant such application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the MahindanandaAluthgamage Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. 75of 2009."
  },
