    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nFINANCE (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 15 OF 2011\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 31st March, 2011]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of April 01, 2011\n\n1Finance (Amendment) Act, No. 15 of 2011\n\n[Certified on 31st March, 2011]\n\nL.D.\u2014 O. 6/2011\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 11 OF 2006, THE FINANCEACT, NO. 5 OF 2005, THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 25 OF 2003 AND THEFINANCE ACT, NO. 16 OF 1995\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Finance (Amendment)Act No. 15 of 2011.\n\nPART I\n\nAMENDMENT OF PART I OF THE FINANCE ACT, NO. 11 OF 2006\n\n2.Part I of the Finance Act, No. 11 of 2006 is herebyamended in sub-paragraph (ii) of paragraph (b) of subsection(1) of section 2 thereof, by the substitution for the words andfigures \u201c(ii) from and after the date of commencement of thisAct,\u201d to the words and figures \u201cAct, No. 10 of 2006, as thecase may be,\u201d of the following:-\n\n\u201c(ii)from and after the commencement of this Act,-\n\n(a)from every individual who has not in termsof paragraph (i) above, availed himself of theconcession referred to therein, or everyindividual who has paid in respect of anyperiod of five consecutive years of assessmentcommencing on April 1, 2001 and ending onMarch 31, 2011; or\n\n(b) from every individual who has not in termsof paragraph (i) above, availed himself of theconcession referred to therein, or everyindividual who has paid in respect of anyperiod of ten consecutive years of assessmentcommencing on April 1, 2001 ,\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 2 ofPart I of Act,No. 11 of2006.\n\nFinance (Amendment) Act, No. 15 of 20112"
