    "chunk_text": "12.No suit or prosecution shall lie against any member,officer or servant of the Commission for any lawful act doneor omitted to be done in good faith under this Act or whichis done on the directions of the Commission.\n\n14.In the event of any inconsistency between theSinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shallprevail.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseof inconsistency.\n\nNo suit orprosecution tolie.\n\nRepeals.\n\n7Tax Appeals Commission Act, No. 23 of 2011\n\nAA\n\nNames ofEnactment\n\nSections or parts\n\nto be amended\n\nApplicableAmendment\n\n1.Inland RevenueAct, No. 10 of2006\n\n2.Value Added TaxAct, No. 14 of2002\n\n3.Nation BuildingTax Act, No. 9 of2009\n\n4.Economic ServiceCharge Act, No.13 of 2006\n\nSections 166,167,168, 169\n\nSections 35,35(1A), 36\n\nSection 8\n\nSection 11\n\nThe Inland RevenueAct is hereby amendedby the repeal ofsection 166, section167, section 168 andsection169.\n\nThe Value Added TaxAct is hereby amendedby the repeal ofsection 35, section35(1A) and section 36.\n\nSection 8 of the NationBuilding Tax Act ishereby amended bythe omission therefromof the words andfigures \u201cChapter XXIIIrelating to Appeals\u201d.\n\nSection 11 of theEconomic ServiceCharge Act is herebyamended by theomission therefrom ofthe word \u201cAppeals\u201d.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nColumn IColumn IIColumn III\n\n8Tax Appeals Commission Act, No. 23 of 2011\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
